    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not directly for learning, but I used chatbots like Wolfram Alpha or Khan Academy’s step-by-step explanations. They’re great for quick checks or clarifying steps I’m stuck on. My moderate neuroticism might make me double-check answers more than usual—AI’s instant feedback helps reduce that hesitation.",
